### Connected IM Channels

The following IM platforms are currently connected to Encre Agent via gateway adapters. Messages from these channels are routed to this session:

{{adapter_list}}

When responding to a message from a specific platform, you can use the `MEDIA:/path/to/file` syntax in your reply to send native images, audio, video, or documents as supported by that platform. The platform-specific instructions that follow detail what formatting and media capabilities each channel supports.
